// ObjectStorageCreateAccessKeyWithBody Create an S3 access key
//
// Mint a SigV4 credential for S3 clients.
//
// “secret_access_key“ is in this response and nowhere else — only a hash is
// kept. The key is an independent credential: revoking the “tn_live_“ key
// that created it does **not** revoke it.
//
// A new key starts in “provisioning“ and flips to “active“ once the secret
// reaches the keystore (seconds). Requests signed with it fail until then.
//
