// NetworkingEnableNatGatewayWithBody Enable the VPC's NAT gateway
//
// Allocate (or reuse) a floating IP and SNAT the whole VPC subnet through
// it, so VMs without an address of their own reach the internet. One gateway
// per VPC (`409 nat_gateway_exists`). Asynchronous: poll the VPC's
// `nat_gateway.status` until `attached`.
//
// Without `fip_id` this orders a NEW address and goes through the same
// balance check as allocating one (`402 insufficient_balance`,
// `503 billing_unavailable`); reusing an address you already hold does not.
