	// NetworkingEnableNatGatewayWithBodyWithResponse Enable the VPC's NAT gateway
	//
	// Allocate (or reuse) a floating IP and SNAT the whole VPC subnet through
	// it, so VMs without an address of their own reach the internet. One gateway
	// per VPC (`409 nat_gateway_exists`). Asynchronous: poll the VPC's
	// `nat_gateway.status` until `attached`.
